    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:47:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin, good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:47:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Good afternoon. I have question about recycling. [pause] My niece is here, she helps me with English. Is okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:47:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that's fine. Go ahead, what's the question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:47:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What can go in recycling now? Pizza box. Glass. And the plastic that is clamshell, from the fruit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:47:50-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so pizza boxes, glass, clamshells. Let me pull up the guide so I give you the right thing. [pause] Alright. Glass bottles and jars are fine, rinse them out. Clamshells, the hard clear ones, those are generally accepted if they're clean. Pizza boxes, clean cardboard parts only, tear off the greasy part and trash that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:48:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Clean part only. Grease part is trash. Yes. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:48:12-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:48:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Also, how I ask for new bin? Mine is cracked. I need replacement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:48:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, replacement bin, cracked. I can put in a request right here. Can I get your name and the address of the pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:48:27-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Kevin Brennan. [pause] Sorry, I do not want to give address on this call. Can I give later?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:48:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, no problem. You can call back with it, or if you want I'll note your name and number and someone can reach you. Is 401-555-0184 good?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:48:43-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that number. Good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:48:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, I've got that down. Anything else today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:48:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Only, I play chess online every night. I just lost game. Now I am slow today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:48:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, there's always tonight's game. Take care, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T13:48:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
